{"title": "Melee Caster", "pageid": 27985, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Melee_Caster", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Melee Caster</b> is a passive feature that allows a magic user to use its casting ability to attack targets more accurately.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Instead of its Dexterity <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_score_modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability score modifier\">ability score modifier</a>, the affected entity add its <a href=\"/wiki/Spellcasting_modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spellcasting modifier\">spellcasting modifier</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack rolls\">attack rolls</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Rapier\" title=\"Infernal Rapier\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Infernal_Rapier_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Rapier\" title=\"Infernal Rapier\">Infernal Rapier</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sylvan_Scimitar\" title=\"Sylvan Scimitar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scimitar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scimitar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scimitar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Scimitar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scimitar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Scimitar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scimitar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scimitar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Scimitar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sylvan_Scimitar\" title=\"Sylvan Scimitar\">Sylvan Scimitar</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Melee Caster does not benefit other equipped weapons.</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Uses <a href=\"/wiki/Spellcasting_modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spellcasting modifier\">spellcasting modifier</a> for <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack rolls\">attack rolls</a>.</div>\n<